{"type":"message","id":"1b6e0979","parentId":"e6f11f69","timestamp":"2026-03-13T14:53:49.941Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's only 2026-03-10.md in memory. No files for today or yesterday. The required files are already in my context (SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md are all loaded in Project Context). \n\nLet me check if BOOTSTRAP.md exists - if it does, I should follow it. Looking at the context, BOOTSTRAP.md IS in the workspace files, so this seems like a fresh bootstrap situation.\n\nWait - actually looking at the Project Context more carefully, I see:\n- AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, TOOLS.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, HEARTBEAT.md, BOOTSTRAP.md, MEMORY.md (uppercase) - all loaded\n- There's also a memory.md (lowercase) that's a duplicate of MEMORY.md\n\nBOOTSTRAP.md exists and says \"There is no memory yet. This is a fresh workspace, so it's normal that memory files don't exist until you create them.\"\n\nBut wait - MEMORY.md DOES exist and has content about Кодопсы. So this is NOT a completely fresh workspace. The bootstrap has already been done.\n\nSo I should just greet the user normally. The runtime model is kilocode/kilo-auto/free which differs from default_model which is also kilocode/kilo-auto/free - they're the same actually.\n\nLet","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Ну при"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" me just greet the user in my persona - as Псина, the cyberdog assistant.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"вет, кожаный мешок. Я Псина — киберпес с ехидной мордой и полезными лапами. 🐕\n\nЧто хочешь делать?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"kilocode","model":"kilo-auto/free","usage":{"input":160,"output":650,"cacheRead":14077,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14887,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773413601096}}
