core. Where the magic happens. An open platform for various uses.\\n\\n- Updated\\n Mar 14, 2026\\n\\n- Go\\n\\n- [Code](/throneproj/Throne)\\n\\n- [Issues](/throneproj/Throne/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/throneproj/Throne/pulls)\\n\\n- [Discussions](/throneproj/Throne/discussions)\\n\\n Cross-platform GUI proxy utility (Empowered by sing-box)\\n\\n- Updated\\n Mar 15, 2026\\n\\n- C++\\n\\n- [Code](/yonggekkk/x-ui-yg)\\n\\n- [Issues](/yonggekkk/x-ui-yg/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/yonggekkk/x-ui-yg/pulls)\\n\\n x-ui精简修改版脚本，支持最新的Xhttp传输协议、ENC加密、MLDSA65加密，集成argo固定临时双隧道（可共存）、Psiphon赛风VPN（30个国家）分流功能，支持部分节点聚合订阅、sing-box订阅、clash-meta订阅的配置输出\\n\\n- Updated\\n Jan 18, 2026\\n\\n- Shell\\n\\n- [Code](/eooce/Cloudflare-proxy)\\n\\n- [Issues](/eooce/Cloudflare-proxy/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/eooce/Cloudflare-proxy/pulls)\\n\\n Running VLESS + trojan + shadowsocks on cloudflare workers and snippets..........在workers或snippets上部署vless/trojan/shadowsocks代理节点，主流客户端一键订阅\\n\\n- Updated\\n Feb 1, 2026\\n\\n- JavaScript\\n\\n- [Code](/xeefei/X-Panel)\\n\\n- [Issues](/xeefei/X-Panel/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/xeefei/X-Panel/pulls)\\n\\n- [Discussions](/xeefei/X-Panel/discussions)\\n\\n 〔X-Panel 面板〕，Xray panel supporting multi-protocol multi-user expire day & traffic & Device restrictions (Vless & XTLS & Reality & XHTTP & Vision Seed & Switch)，集成【一键配置 & 一键部署中转】生成功能。\\n\\n- Updated\\n Feb 21, 2026\\n\\n- HTML\\n\\n- [Code](/xuexiangjys/XHttp2)\\n\\n- [Issues](/xuexiangjys/XHttp2/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/xuexiangjys/XHttp2/pulls)\\n\\n 💪A powerful network request library, encapsulated using the RxJava2 + Retrofit2 + OKHttp combination.(一个功能强悍的网络请求库，使用RxJava2 + Retrofit2 + OKHttp组合进行封装)\\n\\n- Updated\\n Dec 15, 2023\\n\\n- Java\\n\\n- [Code](/eooce/xray-2go)\\n\\n- [Issues](/eooce/xray-2go/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/eooce/xray-2go/pulls)\\n\\n 最好用的一键xray-argo脚本，VPS一键四协议无交互安装脚本！\\n\\n- Updated\\n Feb 28, 2026\\n\\n- Shell\\n\\n- [Code](/undead-undead/xray-lite)\\n\\n- [Issues](/undead-undead/xray-lite/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/undead-undead/xray-lite/pulls)\\n\\n Modern Xray/VLESS proxy in Rust. Reality + XHTTP + eBPF (XDP Firewall ).\\n\\n- Updated\\n Mar 14, 2026\\n\\n- Rust\\n\\n- [Code](/hamedcode/port-based-v2ray-configs)\\n\\n- [Issues](/hamedcode/port-based-v2ray-configs/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/hamedcode/port-based-v2ray-configs/pulls)\\n\\n Free vless-vmess-shadowsocks-trojan-xray-V2ray Configs Updating Every 4h\\n\\n- Updated\\n Mar 15, 2026\\n\\n- Python\\n\\n- [Code](/xcvtt/miniature-octo-palm-tree)\\n\\n- [Issues](/xcvtt/miniature-octo-palm-tree/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/xcvtt/miniature-octo-palm-tree/pulls)\\n\\n- [Discussions](/xcvtt/miniature-octo-palm-tree/discussions)\\n\\n Обход блокировок рунета 2026\\n\\n- Updated\\n Feb 2, 2026\\n\\n- [Code](/quyxishi/whitebox)\\n\\n- [Issues](/quyxishi/whitebox/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/quyxishi/whitebox/pulls)\\n\\n- [Discussions](/quyxishi/whitebox/discussions)\\n\\n whitebox is a Prometheus exporter that provides availability monitoring of external VPN services powered by VMESS, VLESS, TROJAN, WireGuard, AmneziaWG and Shadowsocks.\\n\\n- Updated\\n Feb 22, 2026\\n\\n- Go\\n\\n- [Code](/quackerd/d2ray)\\n\\n- [Issues](/quackerd/d2ray/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/quackerd/d2ray/pulls)\\n\\n Easy Xray + reality + xhttps in Docker\\n\\n- Updated\\n Mar 8, 2026\\n\\n- Python\\n\\n- [Code](/AKotov-dev/XRayGUI)\\n\\n- [Issues](/AKotov-dev/XRayGUI/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/AKotov-dev/XRayGUI/pulls)\\n\\n A small and nimble GUI for XRay-core\\n\\n- Updated\\n Feb 1, 2026\\n\\n- Pascal\\n\\n- [Code](/binny1024/XHttp)\\n\\n- [Issues](/binny1024/XHttp/issues)\\n\\n- [Pull requests](/binny1024/XHttp/pulls)\\n\\n 🔥QQ：交流群 ：192268854。简介：不依赖第三方的网络请求框架；可用作SDK开发，不会发生jar包冲突；目前只实现了get/post.请求，post支持多文件上传；后期逐渐完善其他功能。\\n\\n- Updated\\n Feb 2, 2018\\n\\n- Java\\n\\n- [Code](/thejohnd0e/VLESS-to-HTTP)\\n\\n- [Issues](/thejohnd0e/VLESS-to-HTTP/issues)\\n\\